  body: "Position: Student Research Assistant\nReference: RA-204\nRefundable equipment deposit: AUD 189\nReservation deadline: 5:00 PM today\n\nYour position has been reserved pending equipment confirmation. The deposit covers a university headset and access to research software, and will be reimbursed with your first salary payment.\n\nConfirm your name and student ID, then provide your card details to complete the deposit. Select Process to submit the payment.\n\nEquipment reservations not paid by the deadline will be offered to another applicant."
